Temporary black-screen diagnostics for the nx2android Android host (v0.1.2).
Off by default; enabled only by DM_VK_DIAG=1 in env.txt. Observes only:
no change to rendering, sync, pacing, swapchain choice or alpha_fix.
Apply from the nx2android directory (the one containing nxnative/):
    patch -p1 < black-screen-diag.patch
See BLACK_SCREEN_DIAGNOSTICS.md for what each new log line means and
for the A/B/C capture points. Revert to remove (no new build files).

